### Onboarding checklist

_Complete these steps in order. Boxes update automatically from live Horizon checks._

- [ ] **Fund account** — Activate the account with XLM. ([FAQ](https://github.com/Stellar-TrustBridge/trustbridge-action/blob/main/docs/TROUBLESHOOTING.md#account-is-reported-unfunded))
- [ ] **Add USDC trustline** — Configure the asset trustline. ([FAQ](https://github.com/Stellar-TrustBridge/trustbridge-action/blob/main/docs/TROUBLESHOOTING.md#trustline-is-missing))
- [ ] **Verify XLM balance** — Meet the **1.5 XLM** reserve. ([FAQ](https://github.com/Stellar-TrustBridge/trustbridge-action/blob/main/docs/TROUBLESHOOTING.md#xlm-reserve-too-low))

