### Remediation

Activate \`GAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAWHF\` by sending at least **1 XLM** (Stellar minimum account balance).

Then add a **USDC** trustline via [Stellar Laboratory](https://laboratory.stellar.org/#txbuilder?network=public) or [LOBSTR](https://lobstr.co/).

Estimated setup cost: ~**1.5 XLM** (1 XLM base + 0.5 XLM per trustline reserve).

